    // Joyce's figure: the proportional lines A, B, C; the solid EK on B,
    // with DE, GE, EF each equal to B; and the solid LH with LM, LO, LN
    // equal to A, B, C and its solid angle at L equal to that at E.
    //
    // Added, all transparent unless noted: faceless hexagons on the solids'
    // outlines (sLH, sEK) to carry the solid's highlight, since a
    // polyhedron draws none; faceless quadrilaterals for the bases MN and
